(Unlike running C code on a PC, microcontrollers execute code directly on bare metal. This requires setting up) Tj
T* (a specialized toolchain, understanding the processor's memory map, and explicitly configuring peripheral) Tj
T* (registers to interact with the physical world.) Tj
